sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as AI Agent
    participant G as Governance API
    participant P as Enforcement Point
    participant O as OPA
    participant H as Human Approval
    participant T as Protected Tool
    participant L as Audit Service

    A->>G: Request action
    G->>G: Authenticate caller
    G->>P: Evaluate authorized request
    P->>O: Evaluate policies
    O-->>P: Policy result

    alt PERMIT
        P->>P: Verify obligations
        P->>T: Execute authorized action
        T-->>P: Execution result
        P->>L: Record decision and outcome
        P-->>A: Return result
    else REQUIRE_APPROVAL
        P->>H: Create scoped approval request
        H-->>P: Approval result
        alt Approved
            P->>O: Re-evaluate current authorization
            O-->>P: Updated policy decision
            opt Authorization permits execution
                P->>T: Execute exact approved action
            end
        end
        P->>L: Record approval and outcome
        P-->>A: Return status or result
    else DENY
        P->>L: Record denial
        P-->>A: Action denied
    end
